206 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Many people exercise at home without proper guidance\054 which often leads to incorrect posture\n\nand increases the risk of injury\056 Beginners also struggle to choose suitable workouts based on\n\ntheir fitness level and goals\056 Existing fitness applications mainly provide recorded videos but\n\nlack personalized\054 real\055time feedback\056 AI Fitness Avatar aims to solve these problems by providing\n\nan intelligent virtual coach that analyzes body posture\054 offers live corrections\054 tracks progress\054\n\nand creates personalized workout sessions for every user\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 207 0 R
     /Pg 204 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

